From d9df4ce86308688ab6da797d0a59b1acb659f4bc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mlgprorektm8 <67933lance@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 15:18:43 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] ryGT: effects fix, frame generation start, slow-motion
 compiles, diagnostics

- FIX-103: compute "metadata clears" run when the memory they write holds a
  picture. GT Sport reuses a fast-clear mask's memory for effect pictures;
  skipping the game's clear left a 16 KB block of stale data that showed as
  pink and black rectangles over dust, smoke and rain.
- FIX-101: V_MAD_LEGACY_F32/V_MAC_LEGACY_F32 follow DX9 rules (0 * x = 0).
- FIX-102: frame generation starts after the splash screen (its presenter
  deadlocked with the window inside the NVIDIA driver during the precompile);
  the swapchain switch waits for the graphics queue.
- PERF-103: compile_mode setting (pause, slow motion, keep going); slow motion
  for every compile.
- DIAG-100/103: thread stacks when a pipeline build or the GPU is stuck.
- DIAG-104/105: frame capture (SHADGT_DIAG_HISTORY=1), auto-triggered by the
  pink rectangles; clear logging.
- Presenter: last-frame reuse fixes; test script steering (steerN).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
